github-copilot plugin: send copilot-developer-cli for a fine-grained PAT.

GitHub answers a github_pat_* token sent with Copilot-Integration-Id:
vscode-chat with HTTP 400 ("Personal Access Tokens are not supported for
this endpoint"), on /models and on chat. Pick the id from the token in
copilot_request_headers(), used by the catalog fetch and the client_headers
hook (text and image clients). Applies to hermes-labs-plugins 346cfe9,
subdir github-copilot.
Tracking: issues/hermes-agent-copilot-pat-catalog.md

